    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Did you think that at least four of them would side with Reunion?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "But even those four were set up by me. After they got in contact with you, did you lock one of them up?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Very clever, Madam. She ran away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Have you still not realized the situation you're now in?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Of course I've figured it out. My squad has been crushed, and I'm the only one left."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Our forces wandering around outside are hopelessly weak, and my comrades have basically lost their will to fight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Is this what you wanted to hear me say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I suppose you're not that arrogant after all."
