            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, these things have no sense of feeling at all! They've completely surrounded the L.G.D. Headquarters!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "We're being forced into melee combat! We won't be able to support you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Take care of yourselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_015_lmg",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent",
        "text": "Roger!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Majestic, isn't it? After so many battles, their minds seem to have fallen apart, but their bodies are still healthy and strong."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Sheer strength seems to be able to slightly make up for mistakes in decision-making."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "At least we'll have ample time to slowly talk through our issues."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "I'd like to have a fruitful discussion with you, Madam, about things that aren't related to this battle."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "There's no need for that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I'll just kill you right now."
    },
