    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "She deflected my shot with her blade?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_015"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto's Guard",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That black-haired kid has a good read on my movements."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Tsk... Looks like their plan is to harass me with sniper shots, and then predict my movements while blocking me off."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Sorry, Madam. I can pretty much predict all your possible moves. All I need to do is block you off a bit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "This way, you'll never be able to close the gap. So, which do you prefer? Sharp arrows, explosive bolts, or heavy spikes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Looks like you really came here prepared."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "But when a chessmaster finishes his preparations, he's assuming that his opponent will be playing the other color."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "(Wait, why is my powder still sticking to her body...?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "(So that's what's going on, I see...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I'm not good with the theoretical stuff like you, but I simply come prepared for everything."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Your chessboard cannot contain me, brat. I am no chess piece. I am Lungmen's blade."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Hmm..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "The line between bravery and stupidity is fine indeed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Or were you planning to pull out some kind of trump card? If I remember correctly, I've never seen you use that other sword of yours in combat."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto",
        "text": "Surely it's not just there for decoration, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "This sword was not meant to be drawn against the likes of you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You aren't worth of it, no matter what."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "However, you must pay for your sins, for all you've done to the innocent people of Lungmen and Chernobog."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Faust",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Right here, right now."
    },
